rills, etc.!\n\nIf possible, please also provide a .psd file, or versions with and without the background! This will be used on my streams and SNS.\n\nMain Form(momonga, energetic, excited): https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1hM3K2_PMZAXTonVE9xbgp7zp8Km6FlTx\n\nAlternate Form (fukuhara tamon-kun, worrisome, tired, pessimistic): https://drive.google.com/file/d/1WA07aJYtdPr-upRPYV37lchvoxNDo3I9/view?usp=drive_link\n\nThanks for checking out the design! <33", "nc": 0, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}], "sent_works": [], "similar_creators": [{"id": 482850, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": false, "acceptable": true, "name": "らぴす教授🍮", "screen_name": "RPS_dot", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1906831474487427073/pRU0GNWB.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/1078044407188750337/1714597547/1500x500", "appeal_receivable": false, "popular_creator_rank": null, "request_master_rank": null, "first_requester_rank": null, "deleted_at": null, "tip_acceptable_by": "all", "accept_expiration_days": 30, "complete_expiration_days": 60, "skills": [{"genre": "art"}], "nc": 145}, {"id": 629457, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": false, "acceptable": false, "name": "遊 ゆうすけ_Illustrator", "screen_name": "YYY__XP", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1743647995403669504/XKIBF2-y.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/1203222366395887616/1746712160/1500x500", "appeal_receivable": false, "popular_creator_rank": null, "request_master_rank": null, "first_requester_rank": null, "deleted_at": null, "tip_acceptable_by": "all", "accept_expiration_days": 5, "complete_expiration_days": 20, "skills": [{"genre": "art"}], "nc": 145}, {"id": 1122989, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": true, "acceptable": true, "name": "あおひと", "screen_name": "a_o_hi_to", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1835838387208790016/A7Kf4VLt.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/p